# GATE-STATUS baseline (tools/status-check.py): claiming status cells and queue STATE lines that predate the gate
# and cite no ST row. It only shrinks: a key whose cell now cites a row is stale and fails until deleted.
# A NEW claiming cell never gets a key. Ledger cells are '<file> <row id>'; queue STATE lines '<file> @<sha1 of the line, 12>'.
